<title>USA: Washington National Corp Q3 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Washington National Corp Q3 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.74		    $0.49</p>
<p> Oper net		   9,252		    6,084</p>
<p> Oper revs		 82,976		   77,939</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,446		   12,296</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 excludes loss of $0.01 a share from discontinued operations. Q3 1995 excludes profit of $0.13 a share from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.88		    $1.54</p>
<p> Oper net		  23,260		    9,176</p>
<p> Revs		     245,004		  236,611</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,250		   12,258</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine months 1996 excludes $2.12 a share loss from discontinued operations. Nine months 1995 excludes $0.40 a share profit from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
